.TH ckman-piv-set-ccc 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-piv\-set\-ccc \- Replace the Card Capability Container with a new card identifier
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-piv\-set\-ccc\fR [\fB\-\-card\-id\fR] [\fB\-m\fR|\fB\-\-management\-key\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Replace the Card Capability Container with a new card identifier
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-card\-id\fR \fI<CARD_ID>\fR
Card ID suffix as 28 hex characters (default: random). The fixed A000000116FF02 prefix is added automatically
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-management\-key\fR \fI<MANAGEMENT_KEY>\fR
Current management key as 48 hex characters (prompted when needed)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
